    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You create an acidic bubble at a point within range, where it explodes in a 5-foot-radius Sphere. Each creature in that Sphere must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 Acid damage.",
        "Cantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6)."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You create an acidic bubble at a point within range, where it explodes in a 5-foot-radius <a>Sphere</a>. Each creature in that Sphere must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 Acid damage.</p> <p><strong><em>Cantrip Upgrade.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).</p> </div>",
